{"title":"Moth Silk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Luna Moth, Great Luna Moth</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"luna-moth\" title=\"Luna Moth - dropped it in 25 of 34 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b4c44c77eff00cb465.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"great-luna-moth\" title=\"Great Luna Moth - dropped it in 24 of 35 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1db74296e1355f07b474.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Great Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–7</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"moth-silk\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"Moth Silk\"></div><h3>Moth Silk</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/20/2026, 8:54:15 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}